    "title": "FUEL LEVEL 感知器 檢查",
    "text": "請參閱 Driver Information & Multimedia – 儀表, Warning Lamp Indicator – Full TFT 儀表 – 故障碼/Circuit Diagnosis – Fuel Level 感知器 訊號 Circuit 元件檢查 .",
